# Frontend

React and TypeScript. Specs: `docs/01_TECHNICAL_MVP_SPEC.md`, `docs/03_CURSOR_AGENT_FIRST_SESSION.md`, `docs/04_TECHNICAL_CHART_REQUIREMENTS.md`.

- Accessible controls, visible focus, and a layout that stacks on a narrow viewport.
- WaveSurfer plays the streamed media URL plus precomputed peaks. That preview is not chart T01.
- Import API shapes from generated OpenAPI types in `frontend/src/api/`. Do not hand-maintain a second copy.
- Technical Analysis and Lyrics & Inspiration are both first-class. Album QC stays an honest empty state until its milestone.
- Never fabricate analysis series, peaks, progress, or metrics. Not-run stays not-run.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
setProgress(0.4); // nothing is analyzing

// ✅ GOOD
setNotice("Analysis is not available in this version.");
```
